__pycache__/
*.md
!/README.md
# zero/README.md documents the rear Zero's image — which this tree DOES build
# now (zero/build.sh), replacing the old hand-modification checklist in
# ZERO_SETUP.md. Tracked for the same reason that file was: losing it means a
# reflash silently reverts the rear camera with no symptom but a worse picture.
!/zero/README.md
/*.txt
# Build products of zero/build.sh: a showmewebcam checkout and a card image.
/zero/work/
/zero/out/
